  "definition": "Enterprise-grade Ethereum client developed by [[Hyperledger Foundation]] supporting both public and private blockchain deployments with multiple consensus mechanisms\u2014[[ProofOfWork]], [[ProofOfAuthority]], [[Practical Byzantine Fault Tolerance|PBFT]]. Besu provides full Ethereum compatibility whilst enabling permissioned networks through identity verification and privacy features like [[PrivateChannels]], making it suitable for enterprise consortia and regulatory compliance. The client integrates with [[Hyperledger Fabric]] and [[InterledgerProtocol]] for cross-chain interoperability.",
